  "content": "<h2>Principais avanços de IA em 2025</h2><div style=\"margin: 2rem 0; text-align: center;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 400\" width=\"800\" height=\"400\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AI Timeline 2025\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"bgGrad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"><stop offset=\"0%\" style=\"stop-color:#E3F2FD\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" style=\"stop-color:#E8EAF6\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"400\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"url(#bgGrad)\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1A237E\">Linha do tempo dos avanços de IA - 2025</text><line x1=\"80\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"720\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"145\" cy=\"200\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#1565C0\"/><line x1=\"145\" y1=\"192\" x2=\"145\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#1565C0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"75\" y=\"65\" width=\"140\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#1565C0\" stroke=\"#0D47A1\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"145\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">GPT-5 Lançamento</text><text x=\"145\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\">Raciocínio avançado</text><circle cx=\"275\" cy=\"200\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#7C3AED\"/><line x1=\"275\" y1=\"208\" x2=\"275\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#7C3AED\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"205\" y=\"283\" width=\"140\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#7C3AED\" stroke=\"#4A148C\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"275\" y=\"304\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">IA multimodal</text><text x=\"275\" y=\"321\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#E1BEE7\">Visão + Linguagem</text><circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"200\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#E65100\"/><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"192\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#E65100\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"330\" y=\"65\" width=\"140\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#E65100\" stroke=\"#BF360C\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Agentes de IA</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#FFE0B2\">Tarefas autônomas</text><circle cx=\"530\" cy=\"200\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#2E7D32\"/><line x1=\"530\" y1=\"208\" x2=\"530\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#2E7D32\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"460\" y=\"283\" width=\"140\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#2E7D32\" stroke=\"#1B5E20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"530\" y=\"304\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">AI Robótica</text><text x=\"530\" y=\"321\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#C8E6C9\">Mundo físico AI</text><circle cx=\"660\" cy=\"200\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#C62828\"/><line x1=\"660\" y1=\"192\" x2=\"660\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#C62828\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"590\" y=\"65\" width=\"140\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#C62828\" stroke=\"#8E0000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"660\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Código aberto LLMs</text><text x=\"660\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#FFCDD2\">Llama 3, Mistral</text><text x=\"145\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#1565C0\">Q1</text><text x=\"275\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#7C3AED\">Q2</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#E65100\">Q2-Q3</text><text x=\"530\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#2E7D32\">Q3</text><text x=\"660\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#C62828\">Q4</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"360\" width=\"400\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#E8EAF6\" stroke=\"#5C6BC0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"380\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1A237E\">2025: O ano em que a IA se tornou autônoma</text></svg></div><ul>Modelos de vídeo generativo<li><strong>:</strong>AI agora pode gerar conteúdo de vídeo realista a partir de prompts de texto.<a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2ePf9rue1Ao' target='_blank'>Assistir demonstração</a></li>Sistemas Multiagentes Autônomos<li><strong>: Os agentes de IA</strong>colaboram para resolver tarefas de negócios complexas em tempo real.</li><li><strong>Descoberta de medicamentos com tecnologia de IA:</strong>Novas moléculas para tratamento de câncer descobertas usando aprendizado profundo.</li><li><strong>AI na exploração espacial:</strong>NASA implanta IA para navegação autônoma e análise de dados em missões a Marte.</li></ul>Vídeo em destaque do<h3>: IA generativa explicada</h3><iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/2ePf9rue1Ao' title='Generative AI Explained' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe><div style=\"margin: 2rem 0; text-align: center;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 400\" width=\"800\" height=\"400\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AI Capability Evolution\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"bgGrad2\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"><stop offset=\"0%\" style=\"stop-color:#E3F2FD\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" style=\"stop-color:#F3E5F5\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"400\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"url(#bgGrad2)\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1A237E\">Evolução de capacidade de IA</text><circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"220\" r=\"170\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/><circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"220\" r=\"135\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/><circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"220\" r=\"100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/><circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"220\" r=\"65\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/><circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"220\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#1565C0\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Idioma</text><rect x=\"355\" y=\"145\" width=\"90\" height=\"25\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#7C3AED\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"162\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Visão</text><rect x=\"345\" y=\"80\" width=\"110\" height=\"25\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#E65100\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"97\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Raciocínio</text><rect x=\"480\" y=\"135\" width=\"90\" height=\"25\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#2E7D32\"/><text x=\"525\" y=\"152\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Ação</text><rect x=\"495\" y=\"205\" width=\"100\" height=\"25\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#C62828\"/><text x=\"545\" y=\"222\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Autonomia</text><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#7C3AED\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\"/><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#E65100\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\"/><line x1=\"445\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"155\" stroke=\"#2E7D32\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\"/><line x1=\"455\" y1=\"225\" x2=\"495\" y2=\"218\" stroke=\"#C62828\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1A237E\">Cada camada baseia-se no anterior</text><line x1=\"230\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"320\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#aCap)\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"160\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#616161\">Compreensão de texto</text><text x=\"215\" y=\"200\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#616161\">Reconhecimento de imagem</text><text x=\"215\" y=\"240\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#616161\">Lógica complexa</text><text x=\"215\" y=\"280\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#616161\">Uso de ferramentas &amp; APIs</text><text x=\"215\" y=\"320\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#616161\">Metas autodirigidas</text><defs><marker id=\"aCap\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\"><polygon points=\"0 0, 10 3.5, 0 7\" fill=\"#1A237E\"/></marker></defs></svg></div><h3>Passo a passo: implantando agentes autônomos</h3><ol><li>Defina funções e tarefas do agente.</li><li>Use estruturas como LangChain ou LlamaIndex.</li><li>Integre-se com APIs e fontes de dados.</li><li>Monitore e otimize a colaboração dos agentes.</li></ol>Recursos extras<h3></h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.nature.com/collections/ai' target='_blank'>Natureza: Pesquisa de IA</a></li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/@TwoMinutePapers' target='_blank'>Artigos de dois minutos (YouTube)</a></li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/@YannicKilcher' target='_blank'>Yannic Kilcher (YouTube)</a></li></ul>",
